#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:2
msgid "Skip or cancel builds based on conditions"
msgstr "根据条件跳过或取消构建"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:4
msgid ""
"Read the Docs provides two mechanisms to avoid running unnecessary "
"documentation builds, saving build time and resources:"
msgstr "Read the Docs 提供两种机制避免运行不必要的文档构建，节省构建时间和资源："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:7
msgid "Skip a build"
msgstr "跳过构建"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:8
msgid ""
"The build is **never triggered**. Use :doc:`automation rules </automation-"
"rules>` with webhook filters to decide, before anything runs, whether a push"
" or pull request should build at all. This is the recommended approach "
"whenever it's available for your project."
msgstr ""
"构建**永不触发** 。结合 Webhook 过滤器使用 :doc:`自动化规则 </automation-rules>` "
"，在任何任务运行前决定某次推送或 Pull Request 是否应构建。这是推荐方法，只要你的项目支持即可使用。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:13
msgid "Cancel a build"
msgstr "取消构建"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:14
msgid ""
"The build is **triggered as usual**, and one of your commands exits with the"
" special exit code ``183`` to cancel it. Use this when your Git provider "
"doesn't support webhook filters, or when your condition requires shell logic"
" at build time."
msgstr ""
"构建**按常规触发** ，你的某条命令以特殊退出码 ``183`` 退出以取消它。当你的 Git 服务商不支持 Webhook "
"过滤器，或条件需要在构建时用 Shell 逻辑判断时使用此法。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:22
msgid "Table of contents"
msgstr "目录"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:25
msgid "When to avoid building"
msgstr "何时避免构建"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:27
msgid ""
"There are several scenarios where you might want to avoid documentation "
"builds:"
msgstr "有几种情况你可能想避免文档构建："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:29
msgid "**Save resources on irrelevant changes**"
msgstr "**节省无关变更的资源**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:30
msgid ""
"Avoid builds when changes don't affect documentation, such as changes only "
"to source code, tests, or CI configuration files."
msgstr "当变更不影响文档时避免构建，例如仅修改源代码、测试或 CI 配置文件。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:33
msgid "**Avoid redundant builds**"
msgstr "**避免冗余构建**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:34
msgid ""
"Avoid builds for draft pull requests, work-in-progress branches, or commits "
"with specific markers like ``[skip ci]`` in the commit message."
msgstr "为草稿 Pull Request、进行中的分支、或提交信息含特定标记（如 ``[skip ci]`` ）的提交避免构建。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:37
msgid "**Conditional documentation updates**"
msgstr "**有条件的文档更新**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:38
msgid ""
"Only build documentation when specific files or directories are modified, "
"such as the ``docs/`` folder or configuration files."
msgstr "仅在特定文件或目录被修改时构建文档，例如 ``docs/`` 文件夹或配置文件。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:41
msgid "**Branch-specific logic**"
msgstr "**特定分支逻辑**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:42
msgid ""
"Avoid builds on certain branches that don't require documentation updates, "
"such as experimental or development branches."
msgstr "在不需要文档更新的特定分支上避免构建，例如实验性或开发分支。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:46
msgid "Skip builds with automation rules"
msgstr "用自动化规则跳过构建"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:48
msgid ""
"Automation rules with a ``Trigger build for version`` action let you filter "
"which webhook events trigger a build. You can match on the changed files, "
"the commit message, or the pull request labels. When no build rule matches, "
"the build is skipped: it doesn't appear in your build history and doesn't "
"consume any build time."
msgstr ""
"带 ``Trigger build for version`` 动作的自动化规则可过滤触发构建的 Webhook 事件。可匹配变更文件、提交信息或 "
"Pull Request 标签。无构建规则匹配时构建即被跳过：不出现在构建历史中，也不消耗构建时间。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:53
msgid "For example, to only build when documentation files change:"
msgstr "例如，仅在文档文件变更时构建："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:55
msgid "Match: ``Any version``"
msgstr "匹配：``Any version``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:56
msgid "Version types: ``Tag``, ``Branch``, ``Pull request``"
msgstr "版本类型：``Tag``, ``Branch``, ``Pull request``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:57
msgid "Changed files:"
msgstr "变更的文件："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:64
msgid "Action: ``Trigger build for version``"
msgstr "动作：``Trigger build for version``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:68
msgid ""
"Webhook filters are only available for projects connected through the "
":doc:`GitHub App integration </reference/git-integration>`."
msgstr "Webhook 过滤器仅对通过 :doc:`GitHub App 集成 </reference/git-integration>` 连接的项目可用。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:73
msgid ":ref:`automation-rules:Webhook filters`"
msgstr ":ref:`automation-rules:Webhook filters`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:74
msgid "All the available filters and how they are combined."
msgstr "所有可用过滤器及其组合方式。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:76
msgid ":ref:`automation-rules:Examples`"
msgstr ":ref:`automation-rules:Examples`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:77
msgid ""
"More rules, like skipping builds for commits with ``[skip ci]`` in the "
"message."
msgstr "更多规则，如跳过提交信息含 ``[skip ci]`` 的构建。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:80
msgid "Cancel builds with exit code 183"
msgstr "用退出码 183 取消构建"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:83
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "工作原理"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:85
msgid ""
"When any command in your build process exits with the special exit code "
"``183``, Read the Docs will immediately cancel the build. The build will be "
"marked as *cancelled* and will not consume build time or resources beyond "
"that point."
msgstr ""
"构建过程中任意命令以特殊退出码 ``183`` 退出时，Read the Docs 会立即取消构建。构建将标记为*已取消* "
"，不再消耗该点之后的构建时间和资源。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:89
msgid "Why exit code 183?"
msgstr "为什么是退出码 183？"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:91
msgid ""
"The exit code 183 was chosen because it represents the word \"skip\" encoded"
" in ASCII."
msgstr "退出码 183 对应 ASCII 编码的 \"skip\" 一词。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:100
msgid ""
"The 256 modulo operation is necessary because `Unix exit codes are limited "
"to 0-255 <https://tldp.org/LDP/abs/html/exitcodes.html>`_, and any value "
"larger than 255 is automatically reduced by taking the modulo 256."
msgstr ""
"需取 256 模，因为 `Unix 退出码限于 0-255 "
"<https://tldp.org/LDP/abs/html/exitcodes.html>`_ ，超出 255 的值自动取模 256。"

