#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:167
msgid ""
"This pattern is commonly used in CI/CD systems to skip builds for "
"administrative commits, such as version bumps or documentation typos."
msgstr "此模式常用于 CI/CD 系统，为管理类提交（如版本号递增或文档错别字修正）跳过构建。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:171
msgid "Cancel builds for specific branch patterns"
msgstr "针对特定分支模式取消构建"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:173
msgid ""
"This example cancels builds for branches that match certain patterns, such "
"as personal development branches:"
msgstr "此示例取消匹配特定模式分支的构建，如个人开发分支："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:193
msgid "Cancel builds based on file types"
msgstr "基于文件类型取消构建"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:195
msgid ""
"This example cancels builds when all changes are to non-documentation files,"
" such as only images or data files:"
msgstr "此示例在所有变更均为非文档文件（如仅图片或数据文件）时取消构建："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:222
msgid "Best practices"
msgstr "最佳实践"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:224
msgid "When implementing build cancellation logic, consider these best practices:"
msgstr "实现构建取消逻辑时，请考虑以下最佳实践："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:226
msgid "**Test your conditions locally**"
msgstr "**本地测试条件**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:227
msgid ""
"Before deploying cancellation logic, test your bash conditions locally to "
"ensure they work as expected. Remember that the condition failing will "
"cancel your build."
msgstr "部署取消逻辑前，本地测试 bash 条件确保其按预期工作。记住条件失败会取消构建。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:230
msgid "**Be specific with your conditions**"
msgstr "**条件要具体**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:231
msgid ""
"Write clear and specific conditions to avoid accidentally cancelling builds "
"that should run. Overly broad conditions might prevent important "
"documentation updates."
msgstr "编写清晰具体的条件，避免误取消本应运行的构建。过宽的条件可能阻止重要文档更新。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:234
msgid "**Document your cancellation logic**"
msgstr "**记录取消逻辑**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:235
msgid ""
"Add comments in your ``.readthedocs.yaml`` file explaining why builds are "
"cancelled and under what conditions. This helps future maintainers "
"understand the configuration."
msgstr "在 ``.readthedocs.yaml`` 中添加注释，解释为何取消构建及条件。这有助于未来维护者理解配置。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:238
msgid "**Consider the impact on pull requests**"
msgstr "**考虑对 Pull Request 的影响**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:239
msgid ""
"If you cancel builds on pull requests, reviewers won't have preview "
"documentation. Make sure this aligns with your team's review process."
msgstr "取消 Pull Request 构建会导致审查者无预览文档。确保这符合团队审查流程。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:242
msgid "**Use environment variables**"
msgstr "**使用环境变量**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:243
msgid ""
"Leverage :doc:`Read the Docs environment variables </reference/environment-"
"variables>` like ``READTHEDOCS_VERSION_TYPE`` to make your conditions more "
"precise."
msgstr ""
"利用 :doc:`Read the Docs 环境变量 </reference/environment-variables>` 如 "
"``READTHEDOCS_VERSION_TYPE`` 使条件更精确。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:247
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "限制"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:249
msgid "Be aware of these limitations when cancelling builds with exit code ``183``:"
msgstr "使用退出码 ``183`` 取消构建时，请注意以下限制："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:251
msgid "**No partial cancellation**"
msgstr "**无部分取消**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:252
msgid ""
"Once a build is cancelled with exit code 183, the entire build stops "
"immediately. You cannot selectively skip only certain parts of the build "
"process."
msgstr "一旦用退出码 183 取消构建，整个构建立即停止。无法选择性跳过构建过程的特定部分。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:255
msgid "**Not available in configuration file**"
msgstr "**配置文件中不可用**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:256
msgid ""
"You cannot cancel builds using conditions in the ``.readthedocs.yaml`` "
"configuration syntax itself. All logic must be implemented in bash commands."
msgstr "不能直接在 ``.readthedocs.yaml`` 配置语法中用条件取消构建。所有逻辑必须在 bash 命令中实现。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:259
msgid "**Build is counted as cancelled**"
msgstr "**计为已取消**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:260
msgid ""
"Cancelled builds appear in your build history as *cancelled*, not as "
"successful. This is different from builds skipped by automation rules, which"
" never appear in the build history."
msgstr "取消的构建在历史中显示为*已取消* 而非成功。这与自动化规则跳过的构建（从不出现在历史中）不同。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:263
msgid "**No failure notifications are sent**"
msgstr "**不发送失败通知**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:264
msgid ""
"When a build is cancelled via exit code ``183``, Read the Docs does not send"
" ``build:failed`` webhook notifications or failure emails for it. The build "
"is treated as intentionally cancelled rather than failed. Note that a "
"``build:triggered`` webhook may still have been delivered earlier, before "
"the build command had a chance to exit with ``183``."
msgstr ""
"用退出码 ``183`` 取消构建时，Read the Docs 不发送 ``build:failed`` Webhook "
"通知或失败邮件。构建视为有意取消而非失败。注意 ``build:triggered`` Webhook 可能已在命令退出前送达。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:270
msgid "**Pull request status is reported as successful**"
msgstr "**Pull Request 状态报告为成功**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:271
msgid ""
"When a commit status is sent to your Git provider (for pull request builds),"
" it is reported as successful so that the pull request is not blocked from "
"merging."
msgstr "向 Git 服务商发送提交状态（针对 Pull Request 构建）时，会报告为成功，以免阻塞 Pull Request 合并。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:276
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排查"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:278
msgid "**Build is not being cancelled**"
msgstr "**构建未被取消**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:279
msgid "Verify your condition logic is correct by testing it locally"
msgstr "本地测试验证条件逻辑正确性"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:280
msgid "Check that the command is returning exit code 183 specifically"
msgstr "确认命令确实返回退出码 183"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:281
msgid ""
"Ensure you're using the correct :doc:`environment variables </reference"
"/environment-variables>`"
msgstr "确保使用正确的 :doc:`环境变量 </reference/environment-variables>`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:282
msgid "Review the build logs to see if your condition is being evaluated"
msgstr "查看构建日志确认条件是否被评估"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:284
msgid "**Builds are being cancelled unexpectedly**"
msgstr "**构建意外被取消**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:285
msgid "Review your condition logic to ensure it's not too broad"
msgstr "检查条件逻辑确保不够宽泛"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:286
msgid "Check for syntax errors in your bash commands"
msgstr "检查 bash 命令语法错误"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:287
msgid "Verify that file paths and branch names are correct"
msgstr "验证文件路径和分支名正确"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:288
msgid "Test the condition in different scenarios (PRs, branches, tags)"
msgstr "在不同场景（PR、分支、标签）测试条件"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:290
msgid "**Cannot access Git information**"
msgstr "**无法访问 Git 信息**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:291
msgid ""
"Some Git operations require a full clone. If you need Git history, you might"
" need to :ref:`unshallow the clone <build-customization:Unshallow git "
"clone>`"
msgstr ""
"某些 Git 操作需要完整克隆。若需 Git 历史，可能需 :ref:`取消浅克隆 <build-customization:Unshallow git"
" clone>`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds.rst:293
msgid ""
